 {r}←DeleteMonthlyFiles(folder year)
⍝ Deletes the files "usage-data-YYYY-MM.csv" and "usage-data-YYYY-MM.zip" of `year` in `folder`.
⍝ `year` is a character vector like '2025'.
⍝ Called once the data of the whole year is saved in "usage-data-YYYY.csv": the monthly files are
⍝ superseded by then, and left in place they would be offered as data of the current year.
 r←⍬
 {}##.F.DeleteFile¨##.F.ListFiles folder,'usage-data-',year,'-*'
⍝Done
